.TH PRCTL_PTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
prctl_ptr \- invoke prctl with a pointer as its second argument
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/prctl.h>
.B int prctl_ptr(int option, void *argument2, unsigned long argument3,
.B               unsigned long argument4, unsigned long argument5);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes Linux prctl with five fixed arguments, the second of which is a pointer.
Pass zero for unused arguments.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR prctl (3crunch),
.BR prctl (2)
